<TD STYLE="text-align: left; width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">&ldquo;B2B2C
                                            model&rdquo; are to business-to-business-to-consumer, which is a business model that combines
                                            business-to-business and business-to-consumer for a complete product or service transaction;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 49.6pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -25.5pt">&nbsp;</P>

