<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">uncertainty about
                                            the spread of the natural disasters, health epidemics and other outbreaks and the impact
