<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">Our reporting currency is the Renminbi. This
prospectus also contains translations of certain foreign currency amounts into U.S. dollars for the convenience of the reader. Unless
otherwise stated, all translations of Renminbi into U.S. dollars were made at RMB7.2672 to US$1.00, the exchange rate set forth in the
H.10 statistical release of the Federal Reserve Board on June 28, 2024. We make no representation that the Renminbi or U.S. dollars amounts
referred to in this prospectus could have been or could be converted into U.S. dollars or Renminbi, as the case may be, at any particular
rate or at all.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&nbsp;</P>


